We know that $\int_0^{\infty} e^{-u^2} du = \frac{\sqrt{\pi}}{2}$, so $\int_0^{\sqrt{n}} e^{-u^2} du \approx \frac{\sqrt{\pi}}{2}$ as $n \to \infty$.
